“复习周期与时间分配策略”，保持专注，减少因焦虑产生的内耗 [S1]。\n\n**最关键提醒**\n今天只处理那 2 个点，务必做到**完全理解并能复述**。如果感到困难，说明正在经历“良性摩擦”，这是深度学习的标志，请坚持完成主动回忆环节。\n\n准备好开始今天的 TCP 三次握手复盘了吗？\n\n[内容审查: 未通过]\n发现 3 个严重问题需要处理", "frame_timeline": [{"t": 0.0015, "type": "ack"}, {"t": 0.0044, "type": "message_ack"}, {"t": 0.0407, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 7.4288, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 7.429, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.4292, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.4292, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.4293, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 7.4294, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.4295, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.4297, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 7.4298, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 7.4299, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 7.43, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.507, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 7.6417, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.643, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.6447, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 7.6471, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.6473, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.6479, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.6481, "type": "metadata"}, {"t": 7.6493, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 7.6514, "type": "tool_result"}, {"t": 7.6519, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 7.6521, "type": "tool_result"}, {"t": 7.6522, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 8.2618, "type": "status_update"}, {"t": 8.2623, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 8.4484, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 8.6206, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 8.8001, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 9.0556, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 9.1937, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 9.3348, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 9.5218, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 9.7052, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 9.8308, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 9.9516, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 10.0932, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 10.301, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 10.558, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 10.8158, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 11.0056, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 11.128, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 11.3147, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 11.4783, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 11.7373, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 11.9302, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 12.1518, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 12.3049, "type": "delta"}, {"t": 12.4687, "type": "